      <title>OVHcloud因AI内存挤压上调服务价格 非AI基础设施成本传导</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/OVHcloud%E5%9B%A0AI%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8C%A4%E5%8E%8B%E4%B8%8A%E8%B0%83%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E4%BB%B7%E6%A0%BC-%E9%9D%9EAI%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E4%BC%A0%E5%AF%BC/</link>
